v2.9.7
Moved CheckGame() later in the EXE pipeline.
Prevented game/resource fallback from running before known installer/SFX detection.
Improved EXE detection priority for installer archives before generic 7-Zip probing.
Added Atlantis installer detection heuristic for DiE:
Detects Delphi/VCL/Turbo Linker based installers with FILES resource.
Keeps DiE as primary detector instead of incorrectly falling to Exeinfo PE.
Minor cleanup/reordering in pipeline comments and logic.